+wall_exception shares the actual ONE EXCEPTION texture through the generator's patterns_changed signal. EXCEPTION replaces its image while the collision stays fixed. TURN WALL moves a 25 mm slab and its matching collision shape on an AnimatableBody3D through 90 degrees, taking about 2.5 seconds. The map's turning_wall declaration and placed owner allow the museum to omit the replaced boundary cells. A separate landing and glass rails supply a finite outside. The occupied clearance inhibits the start of a turn and pauses a turn already in progress.
